# Architecture

Separate concerns. Do not collapse them into page components.

- DSL: semantic presentation data only
- Archetypes: deterministic layout (LayoutIR)
- Web renderer and PPTX renderer: consume LayoutIR, never invent content
- AI may generate semantic DSL via OpenRouter; Visual QA, Editor, auth, and database stay out of scope for M0

```ts
// BAD — coordinates in page-local JSX as the source of truth
<div className="absolute left-[32px] top-[48px]">Current State</div>

// GOOD — render LayoutIR nodes from src/presentation
<SlideCanvas layout={layout} />
```

Put new presentation code under `src/presentation/{dsl,archetypes,themes,renderer}`.
